                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What makes Claude Cowork different"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " from conversational AI tools and its core capabilities, including local file access, subagents, long-running work, and scheduled tasks"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
